When importing these to systemd please change the path to where your server stack is placed

Websockets (online chat + multiplayer) need daphne next to gunicorn, and Redis for the channel layer:
  sudo apt install redis-server && sudo systemctl enable --now redis-server
  sudo cp daphne.service /etc/systemd/system/ && sudo systemctl enable --now daphne
  python3 manage.py migrate online
Then add this to the nginx server block (before the catch-all location):

    location /ws/ {
        proxy_pass http://unix:/run/daphne.sock;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_read_timeout 120s;
    }
